abstract: "Download OpenStreetMap (OSM) data into QGIS: roads, buildings, the street network, schools, hospitals, parks, transit and other ready datasets, 44 in all, for the map view, a named place, a drawn box or a radius around a point, styled on arrival and saved to GeoPackage if you wish."
